+### Local path links in custom builds
+
+The local-path patch recognizes plain ASCII file and folder paths on Ctrl+click and passes their visible text to matching plugin link handlers. Relative paths must be resolved against `focused_pane_cwd` in `HERDR_PLUGIN_CONTEXT_JSON`. A handler should verify the target exists before opening it. No escape sequences need to be printed, and existing HTTP(S) and explicit OSC 8 link behavior is preserved.
